{
  "id": "dpf",
  "title": "Particulate filter",
  "description": "Diesel particulate filter in the iDrive 7 look: soot and ash load, regenerations (live, interrupted, history), differential pressure and exhaust temperatures from the diesel engine unit (DDE), read-only; diagnostic mappings require vehicle validation. No DDE write commands.",
